  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a large hot pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add sliced ginger and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add pork belly and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add pineapple chunks, scallions, and sesame seeds. Cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in broth and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped green onions and a side of steamed rice or noodles.",
    "Remove pork from the pot and slice into thin strips.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
